menu "Bench clock"

    config BENCH_CLOCK_GPIO
        int "Clock input GPIO"
        default 4
        range 0 56
        help
            Input for the reference clock from the RPi. All boards of a bench
            count the rising edges of the same clock, so their tick counts
            form a shared timebase.

    config BENCH_CLOCK_HZ
        int "Clock frequency, Hz"
        default 100000
        range 1000 1000000
        help
            Must match the frequency the RPi generates. Only used to convert
            ticks to microseconds in reports.

    config BENCH_CLOCK_GLITCH_NS
        int "Glitch filter, ns (0 = off)"
        default 1000
        range 0 10000
        help
            Pulses shorter than this are ignored. Keep it well below half the
            clock period (5000 ns at 100 kHz).

endmenu
